	(text "Fixed Class 6: CLSA 63.4R, CLSB 249R. Accept only 51W bt grant: TPH low / TPL high / BT low.\nThree optocouplers carry status across isolation to the always-on supervisor.\nNo auxiliary input. APD tied to RTN; detection resistor changes from reference 27.4k to 24.9k\nbecause its auxiliary-divider parallel load was removed. MPS_DUTY tied to VSS (12.5% bt).\nUVLO_SEL left open, following the LM51551 TI reference; validate startup at input corners.\nPOE_VSS is the cable return. POE_RTN is the switched primary return. Neither connects to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 391.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0a6b847a-d057-5a4e-a55b-f6ff14d1aee6")
	)
